# Trim the Vercel upload. The dashboard build needs the root manifests, every
# workspace package.json (npm resolves the whole workspace graph from the repo
# root even when only dashboard/ is built), dashboard/, packages/shared and
# packages/chain. Everything below is never read by `next build`.
#
# NOTE: this said `contracts` for its whole life, and the directory is
# `contracts-evm` — the pattern never matched, so the Foundry project was
# uploaded on every deploy. The ABI the dashboard reads is checked in at
# packages/chain/src/abi.ts, so nothing here is needed at build time.
contracts-evm
logs
e2e
.dockerignore
docker-compose*.yml
packages/*/Dockerfile
packages/middleware/data
**/*.log
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
